n    </div>\n\n    <h1>4.语法</h1>\n\n    <section class=\"content\">\n      <p class=\"paragraph-one\">\n        语法是语言的框架。光知道单词却不懂<br>\n        语法，你就无法完整地说出一个句子，<br>\n        有时候还可能让人产生误解；单词都认<br>\n        识<span class=\"mark mark-short\">，但</span>是凑在一起就不知道句子是什么<br>\n        意思，也会感到尴尬。\n      </p>\n\n      <p class=\"paragraph-two\">\n        虽然提起学语法，大家都是感觉头都<br>\n        大，各种时态错综复杂怎么记？<span class=\"mark\">但是</span>任<br>\n        何一门学科都是由浅入深的，<span class=\"mark\">英语</span>也不<br>\n        例外。\n      </p>\n\n      <p class=\"paragraph-three\">\n        学习语法就像造房子，首先要把基础的<br>\n        语法脉络理清，打好根基，之后再慢慢<br>\n        补充和拓展，让知识巩固起来。\n      </p>\n\n      <p class=\"paragraph-four\">\n        零基础的同学在学习英语语法时可以先<br>\n        从简单的开始，比如五大基本句型和八<br>\n        大时态等。\n      </p>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"star star-one\" aria-hidden=\"true\">☆</div>\n    <div class=\"star star-two\" aria-hidden=\"true\">☆</div>\n\n    <div class=\"flower\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <span class=\"petal\"></span>\n      <span class=\"petal\"></span>\n      <span class=\"petal\"></span>\n      <span class=\"petal\"></span>\n      <span class=\"petal\"></span>\n      <span class=\"petal\"></span>\n      <span class=\"petal\"></span>\n      <span class=\"petal\"></span>\n      <span class=\"flower-center\"></span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"leaves\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <span class=\"leaf leaf-one\"></span>\n      <span class=\"leaf leaf-two\"></span>\n      <span class=\"leaf leaf-three\"></span>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
